#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a student exhausts their available quantum computing time during the lesson, the lines below can be un-commented and used to set up a simulator that partly mimics the noise behavior of the quantum computer selected above.\n"
msgstr "Jika pelajar kehabisan masa pengkomputeran kuantum yang tersedia semasa pelajaran, baris di bawah boleh dinyahulasan dan digunakan untuk menyediakan simulator yang sebahagiannya meniru tingkah laku hingar komputer kuantum yang dipilih di atas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You might recall that an eigenstate of one operator, Z, is not an eigenstate of another operator X. We will observe that now, experimentally by making measurements along the $x$ and $z$ axes. For the measurement along $z$, we simply use ```qc.measure()```, because IBM quantum computers are structured to measure along $z$. But to measure along $x$, we must rotate the system to effectively move the $x$ axis up to the orientation along which we measure. This is accomplished with a Hadamard gate. There is a similar step required for measurements along $y$. The necessary steps are collected here for convenience:\n"
msgstr "anda mungkin ingat bahawa keadaan eigen bagi satu operator, Z, bukanlah keadaan eigen bagi operator lain X. Kita akan memerhatikannya sekarang, secara eksperimen dengan membuat pengukuran sepanjang paksi $x$ dan $z$. Untuk pengukuran sepanjang $z$, kita hanya menggunakan ```qc.measure()```, kerana komputer kuantum IBM distrukturkan untuk mengukur sepanjang $z$. Tetapi untuk mengukur sepanjang $x$, kita mesti memutar sistem untuk memindahkan paksi $x$ ke orientasi yang kita ukur. Ini dilakukan dengan get Hadamard. Terdapat langkah yang serupa diperlukan untuk pengukuran sepanjang $y$. Langkah-langkah yang diperlukan dikumpulkan di sini untuk kemudahan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To measure along $z$: ```qc.measure()```\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengukur sepanjang $z$: ```qc.measure()```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To measure along $x$: ```qc.h()``` then ```qc.measure()```\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengukur sepanjang $x$: ```qc.h()``` kemudian ```qc.measure()```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To measure along $y$: ```qc.sdg()```, ```qc.h()```, ```qc.s```then ```qc.measure()```\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengukur sepanjang $y$: ```qc.sdg()```, ```qc.h()```, ```qc.s``` kemudian ```qc.measure()```\n"

